  "releaseNotes": "Route configured named-client gRPC calls through their existing HTTP handler pipeline without a second HttpClient.SendAsync wrapper. Preserve headers, authentication, full payload-audit hooks, masking, cancellation, ownership and route validation; custom factories and manually supplied clients retain the fallback. Compatible with the 4.x wire format and schema hashes. No universal end-to-end latency improvement is claimed. See CHANGELOG.md.",
